{"root":"terbang","ipa":"/tərbaŋ/","core":"指物体或生物在空中移动，即飞行；也可引申为迅速移动或处于极度兴奋状态。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tərbaŋ/","zh":"飞行","phrases":[{"t":"terbang tinggi","zh":"高飞"},{"t":"belajar terbang","zh":"学习飞行"},{"t":"terbang rendah","zh":"低空飞行"}],"examples":[{"t":"Burung itu terbang ke arah selatan.","zh":"那只鸟向南方飞去。"},{"t":"Pesawat akan terbang dalam sepuluh menit.","zh":"飞机将在十分钟后起飞。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"terbang","ipa":"/tərbaŋ/","zh":"飞行","phrase":{"t":"terbang bebas","zh":"自由飞行"},"example":{"t":"Layang-layang itu terbang di langit.","zh":"风筝在天空中飞翔。"}},{"w":"penerbangan","ipa":"/pənərbaŋan/","zh":"飞行、航班","phrase":{"t":"jadwal penerbangan","zh":"航班时刻表"},"example":{"t":"Penerbangan saya dibatalkan karena cuaca buruk.","zh":"我的航班因天气恶劣被取消了。"}},{"w":"penerbang","ipa":"/pənərbaŋ/","zh":"飞行员","phrase":{"t":"penerbang ulung","zh":"优秀的飞行员"},"example":{"t":"Dia bercita-cita menjadi seorang penerbang.","zh":"他立志成为一名飞行员。"}},{"w":"menerbangkan","ipa":"/mənərbaŋkan/","zh":"使飞行、驾驶（飞机）","phrase":{"t":"menerbangkan pesawat","zh":"驾驶飞机"},"example":{"t":"Ayah sedang menerbangkan layang-layang untuk adik.","zh":"父亲正在为弟弟放风筝。"}}],"derSlugs":["terbang","penerbangan","penerbang","menerbangkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:46:22.549Z","src":"base"}